<title>UK: LME zinc storms to new high, copper retakes $2,500.</title>
<headline>LME zinc storms to new high, copper retakes $2,500.</headline>
<text>
<p>ZINC - Rallies up to fresh near seven-year high of $1,415 in first PM ring. Building on last week's speculative gains.</p>
<p>COPPER - Bounces back above $2,500 level. But still $60 down from Friday's close. Cash/threes back firm at $135/$145.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Comes off lows to $7 firmer $1,585.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Off lows.</p>
</text>
